@startuml NotificationAndOversight
' ============================================================
' Baseline v1.0 — 2026-07-20
' ============================================================
left to right direction

' Actors
actor Student as ST
actor Teacher as TC
actor Admin as AD
actor "Email Service" as EM

' System Boundary
rectangle "English Center Management System" {
  ' Use Cases
  usecase UC1 as "Gửi thông báo"
  usecase UC2 as "Xem bảng điều khiển"
  usecase UC3 as "Xem báo cáo"
  usecase UC4 as "Quản lý nhật ký hệ thống"
  usecase UC5 as "Xem thông báo"
  usecase UC6 as "Quản lý cài đặt hệ thống"
}

' Relationships
AD --> UC1
AD --> UC2
AD --> UC3
AD --> UC4
AD --> UC6
ST --> UC5
TC --> UC5

' Send Notification gọi Email Service (secondary actor) để gửi email
UC1 --> EM

@enduml
